Header cell for the Backlinks section of a category display table.
One row, spans both columns. Kept as its own primitive so the markup
lives in one place (used by the dispatcher's baked backlinks section
and by Category/render-reverse's dynamic path).

Visual styling (background, alignment, smaller font) lives in
`resources/ext.semanticschemas.basecontent.css` keyed off the
`source-semanticschemas-backlinks-header` class.
